# Modules the initramfs needs, in dependency order.
#
# Taken from the first-stage list the stock vendor_boot ramdisk loads
# (device/sony/pdx246/modules.load in the LineageOS port), which is stock's own
# order. Alphabetical order does not work here: clocks, pinctrl, regulators and
# the SMMU have to probe before storage does.
#
# Everything below is built from the kernel tree itself, so no out-of-tree
# module repository is needed to reach a root filesystem.
#
# Two names from stock's list are deliberately missing: msm-geni-se and
# msm_geni_serial. We build the debug UART into vmlinux instead, because
# earlycon cannot come from a module, so there is no .ko left to load.

# clocks, dcvs, watchdog
gh_virt_wdt
qcom-pmu-lib
qcom_wdt_core
dcvs_fp
qcom-dcvs
clk-dummy
clk-rpmh
clk-qcom
dispcc-parrot
gcc-parrot
gcc-ravelin
gdsc-regulator

# pinctrl / cpufreq / interconnect
