pinctrl-ravelin
qcom-cpufreq-hw
sched-walt
qnoc-parrot
qnoc-ravelin
icc-rpmh
qcom_ipc_logging
qcom-pdc
qcom_tsens
thermal_pause
cpu_hotplug

